{"id":"blog-formal-001","group_id":"alembic-core-elements","query":"Alembic 中 alembic.ini、env.py 和 versions/ 分别负责什么？","category":"术语","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"6a9d1d37a85be29050b7f765fa69198aa7d90ff2cb466bd671620ef7fa55f94a","document_version":"4c1b88f552f69140e5816e794a41ecc50b2482223424c74aff71ccf88ab1644d","start_line":18,"end_line":28}],"reference_answer":"alembic.ini 保存总配置，env.py 是运行时控制中心并负责连接数据库和比对模型结构，versions/ 保存迁移脚本历史；upgrade 和 downgrade 分别用于升级和降级。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-002","group_id":"cpp-unique-ptr","query":"std::unique_ptr 的资源所有权和拷贝、移动规则是什么？","category":"术语","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"258bc8c1c587e0436ee635298929c94c8674283c6cfdcacf75dbf18e22ed9623","document_version":"e62e9d5dec2660d19120490acb982b75bbe1b32aa4acd657fa2c209d449d614a","start_line":184,"end_line":195}],"reference_answer":"unique_ptr 独占资源，禁止拷贝构造和赋值；若要转移所有权，应使用 std::move。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-003","group_id":"fastapi-dep-lifecycle","query":"FastAPI 的 Depends 如何管理数据库 session 的创建、传入和释放？","category":"术语","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"a315f39144414e5eef72305568be954f24ef7d4f509ac080cfe5d2c1e32822c0","document_version":"2999a2e97974964a1930c3c9c33a5d2e707fc598331b5a59599d74a864af835c","start_line":552,"end_line":594}],"reference_answer":"路由声明依赖后，FastAPI 在请求期间调用依赖函数准备 session，将结果传入路由；请求结束后退出 async with 并关闭 session。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-004","group_id":"javascript-browser-loop","query":"浏览器事件循环中，同步代码、微任务、渲染和宏任务的大致顺序是什么？","category":"术语","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"ce6f5d6a2c6bd0b82a3658601c084442b53f3f6ff732c494e8ac23505171e425","document_version":"121b78c8b2e34f742ef40c9c95eba8211c9ef06233a038a6111137b79fa4b290","start_line":264,"end_line":282}],"reference_answer":"先执行同步代码，执行栈清空后清空微任务队列，再尝试渲染，然后执行一个宏任务；宏任务完成后再次清空微任务并进入下一轮。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-005","group_id":"virtual-locality","query":"程序的时间局部性和空间局部性分别指什么？","category":"术语","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"ef6f14cb04d2805e4db4e3ec17a4ba0cb69a58b6b621cd0485e20fd96eab1143","document_version":"e8deafa3c67d76feacef253dab8c0127c305e5faf2362f1b1c56415a96200d53","start_line":129,"end_line":143}],"reference_answer":"时间局部性表示最近访问的数据或指令很快可能再次访问；空间局部性表示被访问位置附近的数据很快可能被访问。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-006","group_id":"alembic-workflow","query":"修改 SQLAlchemy 模型后，Alembic 生成并应用迁移的大致流程是什么？","category":"代码/API","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"6a9d1d37a85be29050b7f765fa69198aa7d90ff2cb466bd671620ef7fa55f94a","document_version":"4c1b88f552f69140e5816e794a41ecc50b2482223424c74aff71ccf88ab1644d","start_line":32,"end_line":43}],"reference_answer":"先修改模型，再执行 alembic revision --autogenerate 生成脚本，检查 versions/ 中的脚本，最后执行 alembic upgrade head 更新数据库。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-007","group_id":"fastapi-dep-code","query":"在 FastAPI 中，如何用 Depends 声明一个由 get_db 提供的 AsyncSession？","category":"代码/API","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"a315f39144414e5eef72305568be954f24ef7d4f509ac080cfe5d2c1e32822c0","document_version":"2999a2e97974964a1930c3c9c33a5d2e707fc598331b5a59599d74a864af835c","start_line":552,"end_line":591}],"reference_answer":"定义 async generator get_db，在 async with 中 yield session，然后在路由参数中写 AsyncSession = Depends(get_db)，由 FastAPI 注入并在请求后释放。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-008","group_id":"css-attribute-selector","query":"CSS 属性选择器 [attr]、[attr=val]、^=、$= 和 *= 分别表达什么匹配条件？","category":"代码/API","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"73b7021416f5360d2670128069b1d2fcb6959455db50b518e217eb4b1de8a8af","document_version":"53a43a199e164d5b147eceff66210e4eead904674455ee0f7fd03f188b9e7703","start_line":178,"end_line":194}],"reference_answer":"[attr] 只要求属性存在，等号要求完全相等，^= 匹配开头，$= 匹配结尾，*= 匹配包含子串。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-009","group_id":"async-generator-use","query":"异步生成器如何按需、分批地抓取多个来源并交给消费者处理？","category":"代码/API","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"1fde8a8cb973e8ec859cc032b09156182003e7e76747230e5909b6d1022252d3","document_version":"8ac33c1c0a93068e8e7edfff44727b207bd56a5f7177be39b7c3224e9e0db238","start_line":105,"end_line":176}],"reference_answer":"使用 async function*，逐个 await 请求并 yield 数据；消费者用 for await 消费，因此只有下游准备好时才继续拉取下一项。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-010","group_id":"agent-loop-branches","query":"Agent Runtime 的主循环如何区分 final、clarification 和 tool_call 三种响应？","category":"代码/API","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"282e8f6cedf863adcca299365f7fc534ade8ae6ec578c0b2390be237eef803b5","document_version":"376f4ebab464f5f685b5415354e5e16fbf9d880f708f60cbaf913fbff5ff1a73","start_line":382,"end_line":455}],"reference_answer":"final 直接完成 Run，clarification 暂停并向用户获取澄清，tool_call 执行工具并把结果带回循环继续处理。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-011","group_id":"cpp-weak-ptr-rewrite","query":"为什么循环引用场景下应把一侧的 shared_ptr 改为 weak_ptr？","category":"改写","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"258bc8c1c587e0436ee635298929c94c8674283c6cfdcacf75dbf18e22ed9623","document_version":"e62e9d5dec2660d19120490acb982b75bbe1b32aa4acd657fa2c209d449d614a","start_line":213,"end_line":254}],"reference_answer":"weak_ptr 只观察对象而不增加引用计数，因此能打破双方 shared_ptr 互相等待析构的循环；使用前应通过 lock 获取临时 shared_ptr。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-012","group_id":"nginx-gateway-rewrite","query":"为什么个人项目部署时可以把 Nginx 放在后端前面，而不是直接暴露后端？","category":"改写","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"b8314f5d153900025af0185f4a019891f1718911abd36d8634a5e3b261632b9e","document_version":"1afacc273572d42c9c0ef8df6b1cb3e53cf24151f151e9beb85b6cdd69635367","start_line":47,"end_line":59}],"reference_answer":"Nginx 作为网关和反向代理承接公网流量，可处理静态文件、分流、限流或拒绝明显异常请求并终止 TLS，从而减少后端压力；它不是无条件保证服务器不会被打垮。"}
