{"id":"blog-formal-014","group_id":"attention-cross-qkv-head","query":"Q、K、V 的职责分化如何帮助理解多头注意力中多个独立子空间的作用？","category":"跨文章","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"b2abc1ccf555c3b8a4ad35b14bd92bb1f7cc2197282c714748d53f31006e2506","document_version":"9724649fb3af69614c91b71e134b716bb1e10650fae4c26450767eaa788bb429","start_line":13,"end_line":31},{"document_id":"aeaf64c955edd245f651792871c66a28186e5e5077e7ddca8ad54a14badd1e3d","document_version":"fb595e9997f4bde962b416f8d79201b357258e08aa70bf7ee5281c4fe48f958e","start_line":13,"end_line":35}],"reference_answer":"Q、K、V 让每个 Token 分别表达查询、匹配和传递信息的职责；多头注意力为不同头使用独立投影矩阵，使模型能在多个子空间并行表达不同关系。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-015","group_id":"agent-stream-cross","query":"Agent 的工具循环和异步生成器在处理阶段性结果时分别承担什么职责？","category":"跨文章","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"282e8f6cedf863adcca299365f7fc534ade8ae6ec578c0b2390be237eef803b5","document_version":"376f4ebab464f5f685b5415354e5e16fbf9d880f708f60cbaf913fbff5ff1a73","start_line":411,"end_line":455},{"document_id":"1fde8a8cb973e8ec859cc032b09156182003e7e76747230e5909b6d1022252d3","document_version":"8ac33c1c0a93068e8e7edfff44727b207bd56a5f7177be39b7c3224e9e0db238","start_line":178,"end_line":200}],"reference_answer":"Agent 工具循环根据模型响应决定继续调用工具、暂停或完成；异步生成器则通过 await 加 yield 按需产生流式或分批结果，二者都强调阶段性处理但职责不同。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-016","group_id":"hard-negative-pointer-ownership","query":"如果两个对象需要互相访问，是否应该让两个方向都使用 shared_ptr？请说明风险和替代方式。","category":"硬负例","split":"dev","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"258bc8c1c587e0436ee635298929c94c8674283c6cfdcacf75dbf18e22ed9623","document_version":"e62e9d5dec2660d19120490acb982b75bbe1b32aa4acd657fa2c209d449d614a","start_line":213,"end_line":269}],"reference_answer":"不应默认双向 shared_ptr；互相持有会造成引用计数无法归零的循环引用。通常让非拥有的一侧使用 weak_ptr，并在使用前 lock。"}
