{"id":"blog-formal-020","group_id":"mesi-states","query":"MESI 协议中的 M、E、S、I 四种状态各表示什么？","category":"术语","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"ef6f14cb04d2805e4db4e3ec17a4ba0cb69a58b6b621cd0485e20fd96eab1143","document_version":"e8deafa3c67d76feacef253dab8c0127c305e5faf2362f1b1c56415a96200d53","start_line":287,"end_line":310}],"reference_answer":"M 是已修改且与主存不一致，E 是独占且未修改，S 是多核共享且一致，I 是无效。"}
