{"id":"blog-formal-022","group_id":"promise-limitations","query":"Promise 状态一次改变后为什么不能直接重置，重试通常应怎么组织？","category":"术语","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"ce6f5d6a2c6bd0b82a3658601c084442b53f3f6ff732c494e8ac23505171e425","document_version":"121b78c8b2e34f742ef40c9c95eba8211c9ef06233a038a6111137b79fa4b290","start_line":413,"end_line":549}],"reference_answer":"Promise 状态设计为一次性，改变后不能重置；要重试应把逻辑封装为函数，每次重新创建 Promise。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-023","group_id":"python-project-layers","query":"现代 Python 项目中，requirements.txt、pyproject.toml、.env.example 和 .env 分别承担什么角色？","category":"术语","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"97dba46f9c5372f95e7f3bb29acf2339a28a5925c9b8e1627b0980350c5b3cfb","document_version":"e5ec52c722ba627ead33fd1323bc47c255821e15bfdbb782de16581c984ee1c6","start_line":10,"end_line":41}],"reference_answer":"requirements.txt 声明依赖，pyproject.toml 保存项目元信息和工具配置，.env.example 是可提交的环境变量示例，.env 保存本机真实变量且不应提交。"}
