{"id":"blog-formal-026","group_id":"css-pseudo-element","query":"CSS 伪元素和普通子节点有什么区别，::before/::after 为什么需要 content？","category":"代码/API","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"73b7021416f5360d2670128069b1d2fcb6959455db50b518e217eb4b1de8a8af","document_version":"53a43a199e164d5b147eceff66210e4eead904674455ee0f7fd03f188b9e7703","start_line":454,"end_line":501}],"reference_answer":"伪元素是在渲染层面伪造的子节点，生命周期绑定宿主且不能独立绑定事件；::before 和 ::after 需要 content 创建可渲染内容。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-027","group_id":"async-generator-python","query":"Python 异步生成器示例如何逐个请求 URL，并由消费者异步迭代结果？","category":"代码/API","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"1fde8a8cb973e8ec859cc032b09156182003e7e76747230e5909b6d1022252d3","document_version":"8ac33c1c0a93068e8e7edfff44727b207bd56a5f7177be39b7c3224e9e0db238","start_line":148,"end_line":174}],"reference_answer":"在 async generator 中使用 AsyncClient 逐个请求并 yield JSON 数据，消费者使用 async for 逐项处理。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-028","group_id":"agent-checkpoint-restore","query":"Agent Runtime 恢复 Run 时，checkpoint 和 session metadata 分别如何参与恢复？","category":"代码/API","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"282e8f6cedf863adcca299365f7fc534ade8ae6ec578c0b2390be237eef803b5","document_version":"376f4ebab464f5f685b5415354e5e16fbf9d880f708f60cbaf913fbff5ff1a73","start_line":267,"end_line":324}],"reference_answer":"先读取 Run、Session 和 checkpoint；有 checkpoint 时恢复状态和计数器，没有时从 session metadata 中提取 ContextState 字段，再读取事件恢复消息和序号。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-029","group_id":"multihead-dimension","query":"多头注意力为什么不会简单地把注意力层总维度扩大为头数的倍数？","category":"改写","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"aeaf64c955edd245f651792871c66a28186e5e5077e7ddca8ad54a14badd1e3d","document_version":"fb595e9997f4bde962b416f8d79201b357258e08aa70bf7ee5281c4fe48f958e","start_line":69,"end_line":83}],"reference_answer":"总维度会分配给各个头，通常令 d_k=d_model/h，因此所有头合计处理的维度仍为 d_model，同时可以并行计算。"}
{"id":"blog-formal-030","group_id":"virtual-address-flow","query":"逻辑地址、线性地址、虚拟地址和物理地址之间的转换关系是什么？","category":"改写","split":"test","answerable":true,"relevant_spans":[{"document_id":"ef6f14cb04d2805e4db4e3ec17a4ba0cb69a58b6b621cd0485e20fd96eab1143","document_version":"e8deafa3c67d76feacef253dab8c0127c305e5faf2362f1b1c56415a96200d53","start_line":204,"end_line":227}],"reference_answer":"逻辑地址经分段得到线性/虚拟地址，再经分页得到物理地址；现代 64 位系统的扁平分段模型下三种逻辑上的地址可基本统一。"}
